    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86833095249aea3040170861",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我完全无法理解其中的含义。\r\n不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "de537d2ff9b19750cf33ff130f66abceccc3cc8a6ad77f1d77dd7ecb357da5ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        63,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/63/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73e27c59c8363a039d94eda0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“SETO”。\r\n若是能理解这个词的含义，\r\n我们便能迈出今年的第一步吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "079d88118ad13a93f8783b47f4ab48be76b1d4f3e7fa7b7c0ef29feb445c391c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ddda378e98523052c8b825d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她垂下双眼。\r\n也许按照她那“未来预测”的结果——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ced568787dedba03d35044bde267380c04e6fb681c768e764dd8f61b4144217c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7d974135730a2b93382e427",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在经典三冠路线之后参加『天皇赏（春）』，\r\n并不能得到太好的成果……\r\n她大概是感知到了这一点吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60b5e2c3d0807d13704bd44e448ba0db4619da493beb76ca81cd2c4238188ee0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
